{"id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetic-truth.md","title":"Arithmetic Truth","display":"df-arithmetic-truth — Arithmetic Truth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","aliases":["92-df-arithmetic-truth"],"display":"df-arithmetic-truth — Arithmetic Truth","depends_on":["[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-model]]"],"source":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开","source_status":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetic-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetic-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-truth — Arithmetic Truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (arithmetic sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (definition-target external truth predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}truth} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(\\mathbb N)\\;(\\mathfrak N_G,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}truth} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(\\mathbb N)\\;(\\mathfrak N_G,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算术真理：在标准模型<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中为真</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中成立</li>\n<li>真算术<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA} = \\{\\varphi : \\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA} = \\{\\varphi : \\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>可靠性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\varphi \\Rightarrow \\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\">\\(T \\vdash \\varphi \\Rightarrow \\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>Tarski不可定义性：算术真理不可在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中定义</li>\n<li>算术真理不可递归枚举</li>\n<li>对一致、递归可公理化且足够强的理论，由其标准可证性谓词构造的 Gödel 句是真算术句但在该理论中不可证</li>\n<li>真与可证的分离是不完备性的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (arithmetic sentence, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N_G$ (standard model, see [[92-df-standard-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G$ (assignment constructor, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_G$ (satisfaction relation, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}truth} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(\\mathbb N)\\;(\\mathfrak N_G,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA} = \\{\\varphi : \\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T \\vdash \\varphi \\Rightarrow \\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (external truth predicate, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])"},{"id":"275a460122ba5530","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (external arithmetic truth, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])"},{"id":"11